00:41:16.290 --> 00:41:56.260
<v Ira Glass>This thing goes on. It's really this very odd human document, both of her denial and of what happens. "As we grew closer, he revealed other dreams and fantasies he had. Some, like the dream of us being lions and mating together, were wonderful turn-ons for me. I don't judge people's dreams. They can't control what their mind does when they're asleep. Others, like a fantasy of us being horses, struck me as odd, but not totally insane. Even the fact that he wanted to have sex with me on horseback didn't seem too strange to me. Impractical, uncomfortable, yes. Strange, no.
<v Ira Glass>这东西还在继续。这真的是一份非常奇怪的人类文档，既有她的否认，也有后续发生的事情。“随着我们关系更加亲密，他透露了其他梦想和幻想。有些，像我们变成狮子一起交配的梦，对我来说是非常美妙的刺激。我不评判别人的梦想。当他们睡着时，他们无法控制大脑做什么。其他的，像我们变成马的幻想，让我觉得很奇怪，但并不完全疯狂。甚至他想在马背上和我做爱的事实对我来说也没觉得太奇怪。不切实际、不舒服，是的。奇怪，不。”

00:41:56.260 --> 00:42:17.350
<v Ira Glass>He asked me if I thought having sex with an animal would constitute adultery. This should've clued me in, but perhaps I was blind to something that was so out of the question. I thought what most people think, that only desperate people would ever have to resort to an animal. I figured horny teenagers with no other outlet, or really gruesome-looking adults.
