<v Ez Malone>[音乐播放 - 埃兹·马隆]

00:54:29.370 --> 00:54:37.210
<v Ez Malone>Then I had three chords. And I rushed downstairs. I could not get down there fast enough and show him the three chords I'd learned. I ran up to him. I said, "Dad, listen to his."
<v Ez Malone>然后我有了三个和弦。我冲下楼。我迫不及待地想向他展示我学会的三个和弦。我跑到他面前。我说：“爸爸，听听这个。”

